**Status (2026-08-31, D21 closed):** The adapter contract is COMPLETE.
Steps b, c, and e landed on top of a+d: **b** — `PreflightBatch`, the
dry-run Submit (one implementation: the SAME admit/registered/validate
path a real submission runs, stopped before materialization — no LSN, no
