adapter-crate bijection; a new adapter that skips the contract fails CI).
The wire protocol gained two RPCs (Preflight, GetValidationManifest);
the operation registry grew to 16 ops with `preflight_batch`; the seam
inventory is 36 (+ingest-preflight, +ingest-manifest-parity). What
remains in Wave 2: **D19** (SaaS adapters; external credentials), **D1**
(table adapters; the arrow/parquet decision recorded in PUBLISHING),
**PX4** (the `loanlight-engineering/docs` checkout), and **D17**
(sequenced after D13 proves out). Wave 3 unchanged.

