**Post-audit baseline (2026-08-26, pre-A-PRD):** 194 tests / 0 failed
across 70 suites; fingerprint `e1f7d17b…ddc9b2`; SLO benches green
(search p50 ≈27µs; khop p50 ≈288µs against the 300µs budget); live
Falkor suites 7/7 (storage), 6/6 (cypher), 3/3 (fencing), 6/6
(cluster), SSE 1/1, cross-node 2/2; 3-node compose converges after
leader-kill in 1290-1448ms (M5 AC < 2s).

**Pre-audit baseline (2026-08-25, post-round-3):** 138 tests / 0 failed
across 68 suites; fingerprint `d8bcd004…4e8c`.

## PRD index

Every PRD in the repo, what it owns, and where its work sits in the sequence.
A PRD that is not listed here is not accepted work.

| PRD | Owns | State |
|---|---|---|
| `docs/prd/exocortex-core-prd.md` | The authoritative spec. Every `§`-reference in code points here | Shipped through M0-M8; still authority |
| `docs/prd/agent-instructions-prd.md` | The agent playbook, `preflight_wrapup`, write grouping, producer kinds, the generated-vs-prose split in the CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md block | Shipped (A-PRD rows in Done) |
| `docs/prd/mintlify-docs-integration-prd.md` | The docs producer's ingest contract | Shipped as its own repo (ML1); first real-corpus run is PX4, Wave 2 |
| `docs/prd/backup-restore-prd.md` | `--export` / `--import`, fingerprint-gated, all-or-nothing | Shipped (BR-PRD rows in Done); its restore gate is relaxed by OC-PRD |
| `docs/prd/ontology-compatibility-prd.md` | How two components decide they may exchange data: the fingerprint, its six enforcement sites, and their migration | **Shipped** (Wave 0; OC-PRD rows in Done) |
| `docs/prd/exocortex-palantir-expansion-prd.md` | Second pack, pack-registered Actions/Functions, seam inventory, first real docs run, read-only explorer | **Wave 1 complete** (PX1-PX3, PX6, PX2 all closed); PX4 is Wave 2, PX5 is Wave 3 |
| `docs/bug-prd-codebase-audit.md` | The 70-defect audit and its fix order | Closed in sweep rounds 4-5 |
| `docs/bug-prd-standalone-readback.md` | Zero-setup mode's write→read loop | Closed (SR-PRD) |
| `docs/bug-prd-external-key-identity.md` | `ExternalKey` identity stability | Closed |
| `docs/prd/adapter-contract-prd.md` | Projection bounds, adapter-side validation, source-schema evolution — the contract every table/CDC/API adapter needs | **Shipped** (Wave 2, D21 a-e complete; D1/D19/D20 unblocked) |
| `docs/reviews/round-<n>-review.prd` | Findings against completed work; rounds 1, 2, 3, and 6 are closed | Round 6 closed — all gates and strict review clean |

Bug PRDs keep their `docs/` paths because source comments cite them; feature
PRDs live in `docs/prd/`.

## Initial build (M0–M8, shipped 2026-08)

All nine milestones landed in order, one commit each, every gate green at
each step (88 tests at completion).

| Milestone | Delivered |
|---|---|
| M0 | Workspace scaffolding: kernel, wire, xtask; toolchain/dep pins resolved (deviations recorded in `docs/MILESTONE_REPORT.md`) |
| M1 | Ontology: `pack!` macro engine, dev-v1 pack (13 memory types, 12 entity types, 48 kinds), R-Pk/R-T validators |
| M2 | Storage: `Storage` trait, registered Cypher catalogue, FalkorDB adapter, InMemory double, bi-temporal reads |
| M3 | Cache + MCP client: ArcSwap snapshots, 2Q admission, sled WAL, stdio MCP server, search SLO bench (100k) |
| M4 | Reasoning: Crepe R1–R9 + D1–D6 fixpoints, Steel explain traces + R6, idempotent derived-edge writeback |
| M5 | Cluster: owner leases with epoch fencing, HMAC-signed envelopes, peer admission, SSE change feed |
| M6 | Ingestion: IngestService pipeline (HMAC → checksum → fingerprint → ceiling → triples), entity extraction, `end_session` tool, worker host |
| M7 | Operation registry: one entry per operation, MCP+HTTP schema parity, audit ledger, goldens |
| M8 | Dreams: MCR² + sparsity guardrails, consolidation cycle with rollback, trigger model, discovery proposals |

